195-<details><summary>Technical</summary>
196-
197:`PalettedContainer` and `PackedStorage` find an entry's word by multiply and shift instead of an integer division ([#1790](https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon/issues/1790), [#1794](https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon/issues/1794)); meshing looks up baked models by index, not by name ([#1747](https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon/issues/1747)). Each change keeps the paletted storage harnesses identical and shows its microbenchmark in its pull request.
