201-### Servers and multiplayer
202-
203:#### Server console, bans and a full admin API
204-
205:Manage a server from a console, ban and pardon players, and drive it from other tools through a full admin API and an MCP server for AI agents.
206-
207-<details><summary>Technical</summary>
208-
209:`horizon-server console` (a text interface), `ban`, `pardon`, `ban-ip` and `mcp` over stdio. Admin API additions: the player list, kick, ban, op and whitelist, an SSE stream of logs and events, a text metrics endpoint, config GET and PATCH, backup delete and download. The last pieces merged: bans edited while the server is stopped ([#9767](https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon/issues/9767)) and the MCP tools' contracts pinned by a test ([#9748](https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon/issues/9748)). The panel's later features and vanilla's management protocol are their own item (server-panel-management). [docs/server.md](docs/server.md), [docs/api/server.md](docs/api/server.md).
210-
211-</details>
