275-#### A new launcher design
276-
277:A redesigned launcher: every button where you expect it, the fewest clicks to play, add an instance or add mods, smooth animations, and instant startup.
278-
279-Owner: [ludovic111](https://github.com/ludovic111)
280-
281-<details><summary>Technical</summary>
282-
283:Based on the site concept by the Team (Bricolage Grotesque, a night sky and an animated pixel sunset). Screens and flows are designed first, then small PRs; tokens in [crates/horizon-theme](crates/horizon-theme) and rules in [docs/design-system.md](docs/design-system.md), the game's vanilla look unchanged. Measured before and after: startup, frame time and idle CPU/GPU, reduced motion honoured. Mods screens separate Horizon native mods from Java mods; a running instance can be stopped from the launcher.
